0..74 Comment "// This source shows a comparison in a stated type whose model two modules"
75..85 Comment "// answer."
86..88 Comment "//"
89..162 Comment "// The signature decides no model for the slot. So the slot waits for the"
163..206 Comment "// body, as it waits in any other position."
207..209 Comment "//"
210..287 Comment "// The slot binds nothing before the body. The decode of the stated type then"
288..354 Comment "// meets the slot\'s hole, and the checker refuses the declaration."
355..357 Comment "//"
358..421 Comment "// Limits: the refusal names the mismatch, not the two modules."
422..424 Comment "//"
425..452 Comment "// - see: #6158 — `twice`"
453..500 Comment "// - see: #6195 — the refusal names no module"
501..594 Comment "// - see: `../../model/modules/model-stated-type.gandr` — a slot that the signature decides"
